§§ `Section 351(k): when a limb applies`

-- The chapeau needs a person who is neither employee nor self-employed with income not above the Schedule K item 3 minimum; then one limb:
-- (1) a benefit or compensation of s 350 (not a full month's unemployment benefit), or a Chapter 9 disabled person; (2) an immigrant, to 12 months from the day;
-- (2a) a student or trainee aged 18 and under 21 who began service before 21; (2b) a Chapter 11 insured, at most 12 months, who began service before 21;
-- (2c) the first two months after service of the kinds named; (3) an exemption by the Minister's rules. A month count at the limit counts ("up to 12 months", "the first two months").

#ASSERT     `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: a benefit received`
#ASSERT     `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: a Chapter 9 disabled person`
#ASSERT NOT `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: a benefit received but income above the minimum`
#ASSERT NOT `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: a benefit received but an employee`
#ASSERT NOT `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: nothing applies`
#ASSERT     `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: an immigrant 12 months in`
#ASSERT NOT `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: an immigrant 12.5 months in`
#ASSERT NOT `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: not an immigrant, 3 months`
#ASSERT     `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: a student of 18 who began service before 21`
#ASSERT     `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: a student of 20 who began service before 21`
#ASSERT NOT `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: a student of 17`
#ASSERT NOT `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: a student of 21`
#ASSERT NOT `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: a student of 19 who did not begin service before 21`
#ASSERT     `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: insured under Chapter 11, 12 months run`
#ASSERT NOT `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: insured under Chapter 11, 13 months run`
#ASSERT NOT `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: insured under Chapter 11, did not begin service before 21`
#ASSERT     `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: finished regular service 2 months ago`
#ASSERT NOT `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: finished regular service 2.5 months ago`
#ASSERT     `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: finished civic service 1 month ago`
#ASSERT NOT `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: finished no service, 1 month`
#ASSERT     `s 351(k) — a limb applies to him` `k: the Minister set an exemption`
